4839\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n* I'd let to get this double-checked and tested by someone from 4.x audio (@allenwp ? ) both because I can't test it (being Linux here) and because 3.x has diverged significantly from 4.x in this file.\r\n* An alternative would be to completely sync 3.x with the current 4.x version of Godot WASAPI code, but that seems to offer more bug potential.\r\n* I must admit this has made me rethink about whether these changes are safe to cherry pick to 3.6 stable, or whether they need more time to stew in master first.\r\n\r\nTo me the whole `thread_func()` here looks messy with all the nested if statements (hence the reason for this bug being introduced) and might benefit from being broken up into functions.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":11568492,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AsIVs","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/21","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/21","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/21/labels","number":21,"state":"open","title":"3.7","description"